{"thought": "Since the file does not exist, I need to create it. The test should use the loads and dumps functions to reproduce the bug. The test should fail at the current commit and pass once the bug is fixed.", "tool": "run_test", "args": {"source": "import tomlkit

doc = tomlkit.loads("a.b = 1\n")
doc["a"]["c"] = {}
doc["z"] = 2

dumped = tomlkit.dumps(doc)
assert dumped == "a.b = 1\n\n[a.c]\nz = 2\n""}}
